      { prompt: "Which one do we watch cartoons on?", say: "Which one do we watch cartoons on?" },
      { text: "Walk around the house and find the devices: the phone, the television, the computer, the tablet, and even the radio, the washing machine or the fridge. For each one, ask: “What is it called? What do we do with it? Who uses it?” Show your child the screen, the buttons, the keyboard and the mouse. Remind them that we touch devices only with a grown-up's permission. If you can, call grandma or another relative together." }
